    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498310/extras/ae7c20b19ef3fc518fc3e14454181a99.avif?t=1740421307\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve had a long journey to get to this point, adventurer, stay a while and rest. You\u2019ll be fighting hordes of enemies, making friends along the way, and gaining favor for the gods, but I promise that you will get through it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things you can do:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hear townspeople complain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill the mass population of every monster you come across.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the legendary hero to recolor the world!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things you cannot do:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Impress the gods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive your past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move the crates.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to explore vast lands and eradicate all who stand in your way?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498310/extras/1502a79780f49d9f92dd8e15c52fee4e.poster.avif?t=1740421307\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498310/extras/1502a79780f49d9f92dd8e15c52fee4e.apng?t=1740421307\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=160 /></picture></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498310/extras/ae7c20b19ef3fc518fc3e14454181a99.avif?t=1740421307\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve had a long journey to get to this point, adventurer, stay a while and rest. You\u2019ll be fighting hordes of enemies, making friends along the way, and gaining favor for the gods, but I promise that you will get through it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things you can do:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hear townspeople complain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill the mass population of every monster you come across.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the legendary hero to recolor the world!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things you cannot do:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Impress the gods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive your past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move the crates.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to explore vast lands and eradicate all who stand in your way?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498310/extras/1502a79780f49d9f92dd8e15c52fee4e.poster.avif?t=1740421307\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498310/extras/1502a79780f49d9f92dd8e15c52fee4e.apng?t=1740421307\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=160 /></picture></span></p>",
